; Hand-drawn sheet jump.png -> sprites 7400,0-4: crouch, rise, apex, fall, land.
; These replace KFM's actions 40/41/42/43/47. Airborne poses are anchored at their
; lowest point (physics sets the height). A neutral jump is ~38 ticks
; (jump.neu y -33.6, yaccel 1.76), apex at ~19.
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------

